# Line endings.
#
# The index is already LF throughout; this pins the working tree to LF as well, on
# every platform. It matters most for files this repo produces for somewhere else --
# a test case emitted for another project should not arrive as a CRLF diff against
# an LF repo -- and secondarily so that non-git tooling sees the same bytes git does.
#
# Note this is not what keeps the guardrail gates honest: `_gatelib.hash_text`
# normalises line endings before hashing, so CRLF churn was never drift to them.

* text=auto eol=lf

# Converted by nothing.
*.png  binary
*.pdf  binary
*.jld2 binary
